BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 693.00 Td (- Chaining \(src/hash_table.py\): each slot holds a linked list, new nodes go at the front,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 682.00 Td (  hash is Horner \(h = \(31*h + ord\(c\)\) % M\), and the table doubles when load factor > 1.0.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 667.00 Td (- Added ProbingHashTable \(src/probing_table.py\) with same interface as HashTable:) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 655.00 Td (  put/get/find/__len__/__contains__/capacity/load_factor, plus slots\(\) and probe_path\(\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 643.00 Td (- Linear probing: on collision, scan i, i+1, ..., wrapping from last slot to slot 0.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 631.00 Td (- Full table: put raises OverflowError when no empty slot; existing key update still works.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 619.00 Td (- Shortener accepts table class \(table=HashTable or ProbingHashTable\); tests run on both.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 607.00 Td (- Server supports --table chain|probe and /table shows probed slots and Horner hash trace.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 55.00 595.00 Td (- No dict/set/hash\(\) used in src/; validation and git-flow rules preserved.) Tj ET
