BT /F2 12 Tf 50.00 370.00 Td (3. Observation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 352.00 Td (Chaining grows slowly: expected success ~1+alpha/2, miss ~alpha. Measured values follow theory closely.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 340.00 Td (Linear probing matches theory at most loads but deviates at alpha=0.8 \(miss 17.2 vs 13.0\) and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 328.00 Td (0.85 \(miss 18.4 vs 22.7\); miss cost is very noisy near load 1, so one run per point is not enough.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 316.00 Td (At alpha=0.9 it is close again \(miss 52.7 vs 50.5\) and far above chaining \(0.87\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 304.00 Td (Why probing degrades near 1: occupied slots form runs. A key whose hash lands anywhere in a run) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 292.00 Td (joins its end, so longer runs grow faster. An unsuccessful search must walk to the end of the run,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 280.00 Td (and the cost 1/2*\(1+1/\(1-alpha\)^2\) blows up as alpha->1. Chaining collisions stay in separate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 55.00 268.00 Td (short lists, so its cost only grows linearly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 50.00 247.00 Td (4. Where the agent was wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 231.00 Td (- Step 4: the prompt said not to implement yet, but the agent edited src/shortener.py \(added an) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 220.00 Td (  isascii check\) so a test would pass. I saw it in the change summary and kept it because it) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 209.00 Td (  matches my SPEC rule that non-ASCII URLs are rejected.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 198.00 Td (- Step 8: the agent's issue comment said the measurements match theory. Comparing the table row) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 187.00 Td (  by row, probing miss cost differs at alpha=0.8 \(17.2 vs 13.0\) and 0.85 \(18.4 vs 22.7\). I) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 176.00 Td (  treated this as single-run noise rather than a bug, and said so above.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 165.00 Td (- My own SPEC was also wrong once: I wrote that the 62nd URL gets "Z"; with serial numbers) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 55.00 154.00 Td (  starting at 1 it is the 61st. The agent's test had the correct numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 50.00 128.00 Td (make test: 64 tests OK) Tj ET
